{"id":"wb-5-143","name":"乌拉泊古城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"乌拉泊古城","text":"乌拉泊古城（维吾尔老文字：ئۇلانباي قەدىمىي شەھىرى，拉丁维吾尔文：Ulanbay Qedimiy Shehiri）是坐落于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区乌鲁木齐市南部的古城遗址。是乌鲁木齐市境内时代最早也是保存最好的古城遗址。在2001年，乌拉泊古城被列为全国重点文物保护单位。关于乌拉泊古城的历史存在争议，尚无定论，存在唐轮台县城、汉代小金附国之都城、唐代葛逻州之州治和金附州都督府府治以及汉代金蒲城等说法。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%8C%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%8A%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":93904425,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93904425","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4f6a0338f5536d2573b3346f.jpg","title":"乌拉泊古城城墙（南侧）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%8C%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%8A%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%97%E4%BE%A7%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/%E4%B9%8C%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%8A%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%97%E4%BE%A7%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乌拉泊古城城墙（南侧）","width":320,"height":240}}